<title>USA: Cabletron signs pact with GTE unit.</title>
<headline>Cabletron signs pact with GTE unit.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.H. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cabletron Systems Inc said Monday it signed a distribution agreement with GTE Customer Networks, a unit of GTE Corp.</p>
<p>GTE Customer Networks will resell and service Cabletron's line of networking hardware and management software products in the United States including its SmartSwitch Family of Switches and SPECTRUM, the enterprise management platform.</p>
<p>The financial terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
